---
/*
<MODULE_CONTRACT>
<purpose>Maintains packages/ui/src/sections/donation-card/donation-card-section.astro as an authored ui authored module so agents can evolve it without rediscovering local boundaries.</purpose>
<non-goals>
  <item>Do not introduce app-specific runtime composition or deployment behavior into this reusable package source file.</item>
</non-goals>
